      "claim": "The F10 project requires learners to use null/NullPointerException and Maven builds/dependencies, but the intake explicitly leaves both concepts untaught before F10 and provides no committed project brief or other just-in-time scaffold. Running mvn against a provided POM is not instruction in how a POM declares dependencies.",
