        "line": 18
      },
      "claim": "Objective o1 asks learners to reverse \u201ca string or array in place.\u201d Java String objects are immutable, so a String cannot be reversed in place; only a mutable representation such as char[] or StringBuilder can be changed and used to produce a reversed String.",
      "evidence": [
        {
